EXPLAIN SELECT * FROM t1 JOIN t2 ON t1.x > t2.y;
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Inner Join: t1.x > t2.y                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |   TableScan: t1                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |   TableScan: t2                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| physical_plan | NestedLoopJoinExec: join_type=Inner, filter=left.x@0 > right.y@0                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |   DataSourceExec: file_groups={2 groups: [[l1.parquet], [l2.parquet]]}, projection=[x, extra], file_type=parquet                                                                                                                  |
|               |   DataSourceExec: file_groups={3 groups: [[r1.parquet], [r2.parquet], [r3.parquet]]}, projection=[y], file_type=parquet                                                                                                           |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
